    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... there's no 'next'. that's the part people don't get. they think there's always a next chapter, but some books just end. the story is over. i've seen it happen to others, and honestly, it looks more peaceful than this constant, heavy nothingness. it's like being stuck in a room where the air is slowly running out. why keep fighting to breathe when the room is just going to stay empty anyway?",
